[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12306.07, "timestamp": "03:25:06", "text": "但是，事情不会那么顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12307.582, "timestamp": "03:25:07", "text": "就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12312.229, "timestamp": "03:25:12", "text": "所以我就想，“是啊，那是什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12321.337, "timestamp": "03:25:21", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12322.07, "timestamp": "03:25:22", "text": "[倒吸一口气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12324.95, "timestamp": "03:25:24", "text": "呃，上次更像是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12327.429, "timestamp": "03:25:27", "text": "实验性质的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12329.91, "timestamp": "03:25:29", "text": "但我同时也必须意识到，我是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12331.91, "timestamp": "03:25:31", "text": "小型流媒体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12334.55, "timestamp": "03:25:34", "text": "就像上次的慢跑马拉松一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12338.15, "timestamp": "03:25:38", "text": "此外，也有很多人表示支持。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12340.63, "timestamp": "03:25:40", "text": "因为他们可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12344.87, "timestamp": "03:25:44", "text": "但是，我的主要目标是获得更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12347.537, "timestamp": "03:25:47", "text": "新来的人。不，或者别的什么。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12349.51, "timestamp": "03:25:49", "text": "[音乐] 体验阶段 4。[嗤笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12351.75, "timestamp": "03:25:51", "text": "但我当时正在浏览常规内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12355.75, "timestamp": "03:25:55", "text": "人群。不，我有事要办。我感觉就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12358.87, "timestamp": "03:25:58", "text": "把他们都烧光了，也把自己烧光了。"}]